{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4ce8cdf2de43066c6f5ad8f458259607be7b33d6ae5cd4e0d769e25735c76a44","ja":"注目を集める方法","zh":"吸引关注的方法","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8a2db053f0d02a3b30aa4d98d66f1936cc6ad1a9a71bf0c55ab3980fb539c897","ja":"歩いてる人に話を聞いてもらうのって、難しいよね。\n突然声をかけられたら、私も避けちゃいそう……。","zh":"想让路过的人停下来听说话，还挺难的呢。\n要是突然被搭话，我感觉自己也会避开的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"028b1d50be77f4dcce49757e1df8042afb8ac8dc43072d58bd4c13ae4df7c721","ja":"駅にいる人なんて、\n特に時間気にして、早歩きやったりもするしなぁ。","zh":"车站里的人，\n尤其会在意时间，而且还会走得特别匆忙呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d6c87f5cd066f8887133f3d96df39a7dff414b7235222d6feeb8da8908e78f98","ja":"うん……だから明日は、\nみんなに足を止めてもらえるようにしなきゃ……。","zh":"嗯……所以明天，\n一定要让大家停下脚步来看才行……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"767611c5da3e5f192f13aeca24708b367234b2e79bd6deccff327c9696d00649","ja":"じゃあ、一目見ただけで「楽しそう！」って\n思ってもらえるようにすればいいんじゃないか？","zh":"那么，只要能让人一眼看去就觉得\n“好像很好玩！”不就行了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d96355cc336b5c5eff4b402ed540a1dde51a10f46b7d184f7eb141397f8a991e","ja":"視覚に訴えるということですね。\n映像は準備が難しいので……写真、でしょうか？","zh":"也就是诉诸视觉对吧。\n影像准备起来比较困难……用照片，可以吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"8b0758616b6a7f64de67d8159c174e1793a24ec6b0284fb92751fadfc9512030","ja":"じゃあ、旅行の写真をボードに貼るのはどうかな？","zh":"那把旅行的照片贴在板子上怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"749f4fb47f0de7a433dde85bb21e44dbd8603da60569212b4b873f498939d349","ja":"ほら、お仕事でツアーの旅行先にも行ったことが\nあるから、その時の写真を展示するの。","zh":"你看，因为之前工作时也去过巡演的旅行地，\n所以要把当时的照片展示出来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"8f9956e622b5cafae7b3219f89147d780720e300acc305de8d176f5e9e60bd3f","ja":"ええやん！　劇場のみんなにも\n貸してもろたら、めっちゃ豪華になるんちゃう？","zh":"挺好的呀！要是再找剧场的大家\n借一点，不就超级豪华了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a434e92908e3bfa1eab6ac7717ec1bba139565f2ccc39bfe5a75d7e861217a9d","ja":"あと、写真が目立つように、\nボードを飾り付けたりとか♪","zh":"还有，为了让照片更显眼，\n可以把展示板装饰一下什么的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3e61b24d97bd4df2dc3bf1b9673eb2f97480406a7f56354a478499f65a55af34","ja":"うん！　さっそく劇場に戻って、準備しよ！","zh":"嗯！立刻回剧场做准备吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481","ja":"翌日……","zh":"隔天……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"5d7439bd57b576f0db93f298360ce34c75cc95f413eba553e6220300904a5c55","ja":"ま、間に合った～！　急にスペース用意して\nもらってすみません！　助かります！","zh":"赶、赶上了～！临时拜托您腾出场地，\n真是非常抱歉！帮大忙了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"fff1f47b1a848599fdda9dfb18db8d6a2886e4d3a5c138f72c8925ed0f18cf6b","ja":"「いえ、これくらいは全然構いませんが……。\nところで、その布で隠されたものはいったい……？」","zh":"「不会，这点小事完全没关系的……。\n话说回来，用那块布遮住的到底是什么……？」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"dc79f4a0d13841265eb394f77d3ab5a28ca4af4c83e7f4ae58bcc184ce3776b9","ja":"これは……ツアーの楽しさをみなさんに\n伝えるためのボードですっ！　み、見てください～！","zh":"这是……为了向大家传达巡演乐趣的\n展示板！请、请看一看吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1598.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"5587b978bc938805a18b2b59e3bb82049adec05e7e0df801a0a2de608f94001f","ja":"「あれ、なんだろ？」「写真がいっぱい貼ってあるよ」\n「ちょっと見てみようよ」","zh":"「那是、什么呀？」「贴了好多照片呢」\n「过去看一眼吧」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
